fandom.com/wiki/Fir_(WTA)\" target=\"_blank\">Fir</a> as their pack totem. Not a huge deal really, except I can't find a description of the Gift: Whisper. Can anyone help me out until I can get access to Rage Across Appalachia? It would be much appreciated.</div> </div> </div> </div>No idea, could it be <b>Whisper Catching</b> from Shadow Lords, seems reasonable for the Totem description.<br /> <br /> <b>Whispers on the Street</b> (Glass Walkers Tribebook) or<b> Whisper in the Dark</b> (Rage Across the Heavens) could be, each one stronger than the previous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-12T10:18:12-07:00","id":1520460,"title":"","content":"<b>Whisper (Level One)</b><br /> In the presence of a stand of trees, the Garou may send whispered messages over long distances - as if her words were traveling from tree to tree. This Gift is taught by tree spirits.<br /> <br /> <b>System:</b> The Garou spends one Gnosis point for every 25 words of her message. No roll is necessary.<br /> <br /> IIRC there is a Bone Gnawer Totem boon with a similar effect, but I forget which Totem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum